Minimal subset of webrtc-audio-processing v2.1 (freedesktop/PulseAudio fork, BSD-3, see COPYING and
webrtc/LICENSE, webrtc/PATENTS): AEC3, NS, high-pass filter and the common_audio / rtc_base /
system_wrappers / pffft pieces they link against, plus the abseil-cpp 20240722.0 headers they include
(Apache-2.0, absl/LICENSE). Unmodified files; everything else (AGC1/2, AECM, VAD, transient suppressor,
AudioProcessing impl, examples, tests) is left out.
